    "Description": "The coreutils packages contain the GNU Core Utilities and represent a combination of the previously used GNU fileutils, sh-utils, and textutils packages.\n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):\n\n* Fix execution of the downstream tests in coreutils-df-direct.patch and coreutils-i18n.patch [rhel-8.10.z] (JIRA:RHEL-151533)\n\n* unexpand: stack overflow with large tabsizes [rhel-8.10.z] (JIRA:RHEL-182699)",
